      "00700bd0",
      "cm0102_prepare_shot_quality_candidate",
      "Action-kind33h branch at00700d19 emits1f7f (config63 EVENT_TAKE_PENALTY) and returns AX of150+random(signed16(slot+180)*5). Slot+180 semantics remain unresolved. Prelude and other action kinds are not reconstructed. Calculation branch checked with synthetic frames and original RNG instructions."
    ],
    [
      "006be710",
      "cm0102_advance_tiebreak_sequence",
      "Preparation slice6be9d7..6beacc uses signed player+35 (community OneOnOnes, not Penalties+38). Base error budget\u003d2*(200-draw*(remaining+4)); must-score adds random(trunc(base*2.25)), score-to-win adds random(trunc(base*.75)), first condition wins. For penalty mode3, final quality\u003dsigned16(base preparation)-random(errorBudget). 3584 original-slice fixtures match. Commentary suppressed with sudden-death flag1; no shared shot/goal outcome equivalence."
    ],
    [
      "006d6f70",
      "cm0102_enqueue_commentary_event",
